r game.","sources":["stats"]},{"field":"ast","text":"Second-year growth plus Dusty May using him at positions one to four. Experts expect more than 5 assists.","sources":["https://youtu.be/XSPJL_mlFXo?t=561","https://youtu.be/XSPJL_mlFXo?t=170"]},{"field":"tpm","text":"Dusty May says he will push Flagg to take more threes, so about 1.4 per game.","sources":["https://youtu.be/0AptxcRW0RE?t=1073"]},{"field":"blk","text":"Kept at the base. Too many power forwards limit his block upside.","sources":["https://youtu.be/dlo7L8Ru91A?t=371"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}